Evaluations run locally in the bounded Docker sandbox. No strategy deployment, trading order, purchase of data, source push, held-out qualification or full replay is included. No tests were added or run.

Keep the laptop plugged in with its lid open during execution. The process-scoped idle-sleep guard restores the prior request afterward; explicit lid sleep still takes effect and can expire campaign deadlines.

